msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:7
#: 8376bc65f1084cf8bcfabd036503fa79
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:9
#: aaf2774fd3a24a3d9cefdabef2cc2015
msgid "把共享同一输入的多张卡片装进一个容器里，并行执行后汇总输出。适合\"同一个母相结构既要走表面链又要走缺陷链\"这种分支场景。组内卡片互不依赖、各自独立读取组输入。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:11
#: f57141c73ece42d598fb4f28d345908a
msgid "**不是做什么的：** 不是过滤器、不是生成卡、不支持组内卡片之间的串行依赖。串行依赖请放在组外顺序连接。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:13
#: 42ea8d731b8040a5a57662af55066e1a
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:15
#: 40901ee8e35348e2b7c32be06f85cb4a
msgid "场景：一份母相结构要同时生成表面 slab 和体相空位"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:17
#: 0135cbd9fe9a4a4ba073239a4ee2c7bc
msgid "你已经弛豫好一个 Ni 超胞，想同时做两件事：① 切不同取向的表面 slab；② 在体相内随机挖空位。两条路径互不依赖，但你不想分两次导数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:19
#: 6f0a7a04ab674687aeb93a022d5d0b22
msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 Ni 4×4×4 超胞"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:21
#: 4f54a400270543d6a528cb528a482204
msgid "**目标：** 把 `Random Slab` 和 `Random Vacancy` 放入同一组，共享输入，并行生成两个分支，统一导出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:23
#: 519efd15157248bebedf623004551a56
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:24
#: 4a600b7b73364004830d6d5a2a7cbf70
msgid "将 `Random Slab` 卡片拖入组内，配置好 slab 参数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:25
#: 31b6bd20d3cf4b18b2a13ba288ac064d
msgid "将 `Random Vacancy` 卡片拖入组内，配置好空位规则"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:26
#: f45cccbcc8a54f0bad655f92448a705b
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`card_list` 自动维护为 `[{RandomSlabCard...}, {RandomVacancyCard...}]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:28
#: 2c52c0089ef0411a8acc9b8170a4d15b
msgid "**输出：** 两个分支的并集——一批不同取向表面 slab + 一批不同空位结构，各自带独立标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:30
#: d99ce68ed8784a3b98dc49eba013ecf9
msgid ""
"**怎么验证：** 抽查输出，确认有明确不同标签来源（`Slab(...)` vs "
"`Vac(...)`）。如果只有一种标签，检查组内卡片是否都勾选了 `check_state`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:32
#: dbb33a147f144c9894b9c48fee881799
msgid "什么时候用、什么时候不用"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:34
#: ab82dd7048c6436394d9379113abf97a
msgid "**用：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:35
#: ab40343acfd349a8bc9cc213796496b3
msgid "同一输入需要同时喂给多张彼此无依赖的卡片"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:36
#: 55dae4c833ab494ca7879f1ce6715965
msgid "多条分支需要统一启停和导出"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:38
#: e9db97cb63214979a6542555d20c63d6
msgid "**不用：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:39
#: adf85d27dcbc4251ba5d50a8102d249b
msgid "卡片之间有前后依赖（A 的输出是 B 的输入）→ 放在组外串行连接"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:40
#: 7463dcc75046430d8a5e6816a169e190
msgid "只需要单张卡 → 不需要组"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:42
#: 9e35235d9e8844f98e301e2cb223b43d
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:44
#: b7125c3889eb42c391ef9bc43836e3b8
msgid "`card_list`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:46
#: fa3f4f7924ad483fa752ed9596a362ee
msgid ""
"组内的子卡片列表，由界面拖入操作自动维护，不需要你手动编辑。每项是一个完整的卡片配置 dict（含 "
"class、check_state、params 等字段），子卡片共享组输入、各自独立运行。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:48
#: daa01b7dceda4eb1ac08a69e2d251d5d
msgid "`filter_card`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:50
#: ea9f0faa4270472d98a796cce16646e7
msgid ""
"dict 或 null，默认 null。选填：在组内末尾挂一张过滤卡（如 `FPS Filter`），对并行生成的汇总结果做统一筛选。留 null"
" 表示不启用组内过滤。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:52
#: b01c35c55e73469aaf102a6122af7d5e
msgid "组内过滤只作用于组输出，不进入下游卡片的输入流。如果你需要在组外继续处理，把过滤卡串在组后。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:54
#: 41023bc654f947c9a3bcf1f257eb96c3
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:56
#: 8e97645aa80b4e14a6ce1e731e4d0068
msgid "空容器（只需要拖入卡片）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:57
#: c95a161b4e844a4897ca037cce5176e4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CardGroup\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"card_list\": [],\n"
"  \"filter_card\": null\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:66
#: dc1f658a07624364a108bc9b3d71a256
msgid "带组内过滤（先并行生成，再 FPS 筛）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:67
#: a68502e173294463ad9e8be84dc7656e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"CardGroup\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"card_list\": [\n"
"    {\"class\": \"RandomSlabCard\", \"check_state\": true, \"...\": "
"\"...\"},\n"
"    {\"class\": \"RandomVacancyCard\", \"check_state\": true, \"...\": "
"\"...\"}\n"
"  ],\n"
"  \"filter_card\": {\"class\": \"FPSFilterDataCard\", \"check_state\": "
"true, \"nep_path\": \"...\", \"n_samples\": 50}\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:79
#: 170638c8ffcb4a1c93057cbe4ba6607a
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:81
#: 46cc440e02834452a28cf98a0f3ef98e
msgid "`Card Group(Random Slab, Insert Defect)` → `FPS Filter`：并行生成表面+缺陷 → 组外统一筛选"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:82
#: e00edd9b3b24466486db0b05fa5998fa
msgid "`Card Group(Atomic Perturb, Lattice Perturb)` → export：同一输入同时补充坐标噪声+晶格噪声"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:83
#: 70edac8ff21c4dc6b9c95bad1ecdde53
msgid "如果两条分支有严格依赖，拆回顶层串行：`Super Cell → Random Slab → Insert Defect`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:85
#: 7e95a98d38954865b9d5e7967609303e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:87
#: 623e010a0c3a48a6ba7eb6918fc383af
msgid "**组输出为空。** 检查组内每张子卡片是否勾选了 `check_state`、各自配置是否合法。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:89
#: b12a31987cb64004b0b36cd7d3f40fdc
msgid "**分支结果混在一起分不清。** 检查每张子卡片是否产出了不同的 `Config_type` 标签。组本身不区分来源——区分靠子卡片的标签。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:91
#: 5696cc1c8a8f4b35997b81ff59302f79
msgid ""
"**组内过滤卡把结果全筛掉了。** `filter_card` 的过滤参数可能过严（如 `n_samples` "
"设太大但输入很少）。先调松过滤参数，或去掉组内过滤改为组外过滤。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:93
#: fadf5d2e01544f288e955caa309839e2
msgid "**想在组内串行。** 不支持。组内所有卡片共享同一输入、并行执行。串行依赖请拆到组外。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:95
#: 74a1224b4aa540a8906a3eef124f5752
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:97
#: 09386d5a3302452eb48f1be838224cb2
msgid "该卡片本身不写入 `Config_type` 标签。标签由组内子卡片各自产生。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:99
#: d4930b2325ac4b74a95566844f08dbb8
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/card-group.md:101
#: 73d8d240ba6949ed8f57670fea9ce196
msgid "无自身随机性。可复现性取决于组内子卡片的 seed 配置。"
msgstr ""
